Core Rules
Week 17 - Semifinals (Top 4 teams):
Snake draft: 1-1-2-3-4-1-2-3-4 (4 picks each)
Timed unlocks: 3-hour intervals, Tuesday 9am start
Sleep mode: 8pm-9am (no unlocks overnight)
All windows complete: Thursday 9am
After all unlocks: 1 pick change per hour until games lock
Teams can't pick games already selected by other playoff teams

Week 17 - Non-playoff teams (5th+):
4 picks each, no restrictions
Week 17 + Week 18 scores combined for final 5th+ placement

Week 18 - Championship (Top 2 from Week 17):
Snake draft: 1-2-1-2-1-2-1-2 (4 picks each)
Same 3-hour unlock system
SNF game excluded, auto-assigned to higher regular season seed (tiebreaker)
All windows complete: Wednesday 6pm

Week 18 - Consolation (3rd & 4th from Week 17):
4 picks each, no restrictions
Determines 3rd/4th place

Week 18 - Non-playoff teams (5th+):
4 picks each, no restrictions
Combined with Week 17 for final placement

Technical Decisions
Regular season: Weeks 1-16 for playoff leagues
Available teams: Calculate on-the-fly (query existing picks)
Unlock schedule: Generate dynamically (based on seed + 3hr intervals)
Transition timing: Midnight Monday/Tuesday via GitHub Action OR manual API call
Unlock intervals: Hardcoded at 3 hours
Sleep mode: Hardcoded 8pm-9am
Team tracking: playoff_picks includes both game_id AND team_id

Database Schema
playoff_settings: id, league_id (FK), enabled (boolean), regular_season_weeks (default 16), created_at, updated_at
playoff_rounds: id, league_id (FK), week_number (17 or 18), round_type, status, created_at, updated_at
playoff_picks: id, league_membership_id (FK), playoff_round_id (FK), game_id (FK), team_id (FK), pick_position (1-4), unlock_time, picked_at, last_changed_at, is_tiebreaker, created_at, updated_at
playoff_standings: id, playoff_round_id (FK), league_membership_id (FK), rank, total_score, seed, created_at

